This helps prioritize improvements.

---

# 27. REMEDIATION PRIORITY

Prioritize based on:

```text
Severity
+
Exploitability
+
Exposure
+
Asset Criticality
+
Data Sensitivity
+
Business Impact
```

Not simply:

> "Fix everything in numerical order."

