# 30. SAMPLE ASSESSMENT

Finding:

> A test server exposes an unnecessary service.

Risk:

> Increased attack surface.

Recommendation:

> Disable the service if not required or restrict access to authorized networks.

Validation:

> Confirm the service is disabled/restricted and verify the intended application still works.

