# 35. ONE-LINE EXAM ANSWER

> **A defensive posture assessment evaluates an organization's assets, attack surface, security controls, vulnerabilities, monitoring, response and recovery capabilities to identify security gaps and prioritize improvements based on risk.**

# DAY 98 GOLDEN RULE

> **You cannot improve security posture until you know what you have, what is exposed, what controls exist, and where the gaps are.**